'''Baki Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Capsule]] during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 796
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Baki Cat
|name2 = Baki Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Baki Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Baki Cat is a mediocre crowd-controller that should not be used outside of early [[Into the Future]]. Even then, most Alien enemies still manage to outrange him—and with his pitifully low HP, he wouldn't survive a papercut.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

